  "body": "## Changelog\n* 890d136102cd4c21863e6dc6d4978d48a5502b60 Add --help and --version flags\n* 368a1118255a3160b38707f23a1c681974edc57f Add unit tests for stats.go pure functions\n* c5eacbb3a705a653f16859d1b7bc9b6b37f30c93 Count future-dated commits as today\n* 675ee48d2351cbd4e9f19cf0d4783ce14bf81e73 Fit summary chart to available width\n* a285b0e5d6718fa2acc58ae16f0d937533254c3e Fix gap-fill test to assert dates exist in output\n* ce4c5d0470ed2a48d04b491dcbcd83fb44abd4b0 Keep pack files open during commit walks\n* a33b04e43f58b4650bb8db297a8ce4050a5e90d4 Make the starting date range configurable\n* e5c2e48296e63f8eab6adb4151533b448857db6c Merge branch 'master' into pr-6\n* ffb78de0899b4e46a53884fe31729c1b855f9cb2 Merge branch 'pr-6'\n* 7b8ce5744e50f86f1474588018742f11124acd27 Rename date test helper to utcDate\n* e9bdc2e2da5e9b1b0e72dd36933e775b36183164 Skip clipped chart axis labels\n* 48f5cb25cda8102b25b2446ec043654a31818f88 Tighten stats test assertions\n* d1bad3938bfbb0023dd338560bd3bcb09e5fb11e Update PKGBUILD\n\n"
}
